flowchart TB
    accTitle: Financial API request error flow
    accDescr: An authenticated financial API request reaches the application decision, maps expected failures through the shared RFC 9457 adapter, and commits allowed state transitions with outbox and audit effects.

    Caller["Authenticated caller"] --> Security["Spring Security"]
    Security --> Controller["Financial controller"]
    Controller --> UseCase["Financial use case"]
    UseCase --> Decision{"Ownership, role, and state allow the operation?"}

    Decision -->|"No"| Error["Financial application exception"]
    Error --> Adapter["Shared REST adapter"]
    Adapter --> Problem["Safe RFC 9457 Problem Details"]

    Decision -->|"Yes"| Transition["Conditional state transition"]
    Transition --> Database[("PostgreSQL")]
    Transition --> Outbox["Outbox event"]
    Transition --> Audit["Sanitized audit event"]
    Transition --> Success["Financial API success"]

    Database ~~~ Outbox ~~~ Audit ~~~ Success

    classDef error fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:2px
    classDef success fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px
    class Error,Problem error
    class Database,Outbox,Audit,Success success
